  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Removing Barriers, Improving Access to Women&#x2019;s and Girls&#x2019; SRHR . Somali.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Somaliland State of Somalia, Nagaad will focus on women and girls in the three largest and most remote regions of Sanaag, Sool and Togdheer. The project will pay particular attention to marginalised groups and strengthen and engage local CBOs, state/non-state actors and health centres with trained health professionals to provide SRHR services and advocate for improved SRHR laws and policies.</narrative>
  </description>
